{
  "dom_id": "step-22966",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Determining the Maximum and Minimum Values of a Vertically Stretched Sine or Cosine Function",
  "problem": "What is the minimum value of $y=2\\sin x?$",
  "worked_solution": "**Method 1**\n\nTo plot the given curve, we follow these steps:\n\n- Start with the graph of $y=\\sin x.$\n\n- Then, stretch it parallel to the $y$-axis by a stretch factor of $2.$\n\nThe resulting graph is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255908/assets/5098e589493c7fc5fbf7802c0a416f6d8bcc85614195091278e89ecdb5b06bf4.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we see that the minimum value is $y=-2$\n\n**Method 2**\n\nWe know that that $y = \\sin{x}$ has a minimum value of $-1.$ \n\n$$\n\\sin{x} \\geq -1\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the above inequality by $2$ gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x & \\ge 2\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & \\ge -2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value of $2\\sin{x}$ is $-2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-22966\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"22966\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"6153\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-22966\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Determining the Maximum and Minimum Values of a Vertically Stretched Sine or Cosine Function</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"22966\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n              